{"lyrics":"[00:00.06] (Ayy, Turn The Music Up For Me, Chris)\n[00:04.40] Oh-oh\n[00:04.68] Nigga, G-Money picked me up today, where the fuck you at? (Oh-oh)\n[00:07.18] Ten racks, it's a Goyard bag, bitch, haha (Oh-oh)\n[00:11.16] All I need is a bad bitch\n[00:12.22] Counting money is a habit, triple nine (Oh-oh)\n[00:14.18] Hop out the coupe, let the doors close (Skrrt-skrrt, skrrt)\n[00:17.34] Every day I'm off a Xan or a narco\n[00:20.88] And I know these bitches scan like a barcode\n[00:24.02] I'm too busy swimming through the money\n[00:26.18] Really feeling like a shark though (Cash, cash, cash)\n[00:27.84] Pop-out the cut with the .40 (Pew-pew-pew, woah-oh)\n[00:28.82] I remember when I used to wear the same clothes (Clothes, woah-oh)\n[00:34.64] Now I got a Goyard bag full of bankrolls (Goyard bag full of bankrolls)\n[00:38.42] I need a passport so these niggas can't tell me where I can't go (Tell me where I can't go)\n[00:43.02] Pop-out the cut with the .40 (Pew-pew-pew, woah-oh)\n[00:45.92] I remember when I used to wear the same clothes (Clothes, woah-oh)\n[00:49.00] Now I got a Goyard bag full of bankrolls (Goyard bag full of bankrolls)\n[00:52.64] I need a passport so these niggas can't tell me where I can't go (Tell me where I can't go, stunt on these fuck-niggas)\n[01:01.32] Walking in the room, find it on my shoes\n[01:02.60] I could never lose, I don't got shit to lose\n[01:03.76] But don't get it confused, I took a loss or two\n[01:07.22] I remember when I lived on Misery Avenue\n[01:10.76] I remember taking drugs, a couple Perc's, that'll do\n[01:14.16] Lost so many friends 'cause I had such a bad attitude\n[01:17.72] All them pretty girls, I'm sorry, I can't stay mad at you\n[01:21.42] So still come through, ho, we can make a move, ho\n[01:25.48] I don't need one Xan, I need two, ho\n[01:28.78] Counted up like twenty bands, did that with my eyes closed\n[01:32.26] I ain't ever been to France, but I got a French ho\n[01:35.68] In a two-door, kicking that shit like Judo\n[01:37.46] Pop-out the cut with the .40 (Pew-pew-pew, woah-oh)\n[01:39.42] I remember when I used to wear the same clothes (Clothes, woah-oh)\n[01:47.02] Now I got a Goyard bag full of bankrolls (Goyard bag full of bankrolls)\n[01:49.54] I need a passport so these niggas can't tell me where I can't go (Tell me where I can't go)\n[01:53.98] Pop-out the cut with the .40 (Pew-pew-pew, woah-oh)\n[01:57.02] I remember when I used to wear the same clothes (Clothes, woah-oh)\n[02:00.24] Now I got a Goyard bag full of bankrolls (Goyard bag full of bankrolls)\n[02:03.88] I need a passport so these niggas can't tell me where I can't go (Tell me where I can't go, stunt on these fuck-niggas)\n[02:09.56] I remember when they thought I was a lame-o\n[02:11.22] Now I'm calling all the bad hoes, lame hoes\n[02:14.24] I don't have a main ho, all girls are the same, ho\n[02:17.90] I was in a Bentley truck, now I need a Range Rove'\n[02:21.32] I'ma go where they can't go, I need a chain like the Django\n[02:24.88] I was just smoking on mango, they ain't even look like G-Fazos\n[02:28.22] My room look like a gun show, need a Draco with a condo\n[02:31.96] Hit a nigga with a combo, I ain't really tryna fight though\n[02:35.64] I be geeking off the X, ho, finna go fuck on my ex ho\n[02:39.16] I do that shit out of spite though, hit the strip club, it's a rainstorm\n[02:42.62] I don't really wanna brag, but, I do it so good I get paid for it\n[02:46.14] The Draco with a Gucci backpack, fuck it, I'ma be a psycho-oh (Oh)\n[02:50.46] Pop-out the cut with the .40 (Pew-pew-pew, woah-oh)\n[02:53.88] I remember when I used to wear the same clothes (Clothes, woah-oh)\n[02:57.06] Now I got a Goyard bag full of bankrolls (Goyard bag full of bankrolls)\n[03:00.70] I need a passport so these niggas can't tell me where I can't go (Tell me where I can't go)\n[03:07.44] Pop-out the cut with the .40 (Pew-pew-pew, woah-oh)\n[03:08.50] I remember when I used to wear the same clothes (Clothes, woah-oh)\n[03:11.08] Now I got a Goyard bag full of bankrolls (Goyard bag full of bankrolls)\n[03:15.02] I need a passport so these niggas can't tell me where I can't go (Tell me where I can't go, stunt on these fuck-niggas)","words":[[0.0,0.02,"[00:00.04]"],[0.06,0.12,"(Ayy,"],[0.16,0.3,"Turn"],[0.34,0.38,"The"],[0.46,0.76,"Music"],[0.8,0.86,"Up"],[0.92,1.04,"For"],[1.1,1.16,"Me,"],[1.24,1.46,"Chris)"],[1.48,2.82,"[00:04.58]"],[4.4,4.54,"Oh-oh"],[4.56,4.6,"[00:04.82]"],[4.68,4.96,"Nigga,"],[5.0,5.18,"G-Money"],[5.22,5.38,"picked"],[5.42,5.48,"me"],[5.54,5.58,"up"],[5.64,5.8,"today,"],[5.94,6.06,"where"],[6.16,6.24,"the"],[6.38,6.5,"fuck"],[6.58,6.64,"you"],[6.68,6.7,"at?"],[7.0,7.1,"(Oh-oh)"],[7.12,7.14,"[00:07.34]"],[7.18,7.26,"Ten"],[7.34,7.52,"racks,"],[7.56,7.62,"it's"],[7.66,7.66,"a"],[7.76,8.12,"Goyard"],[8.18,8.46,"bag,"],[8.52,8.72,"bitch,"],[8.76,9.38,"haha"],[10.06,11.08,"(Oh-oh)"],[11.1,11.12,"[00:11.20]"],[11.16,11.24,"All"],[11.28,11.28,"I"],[11.32,11.4,"need"],[11.46,11.52,"is"],[11.58,11.58,"a"],[11.7,11.9,"bad"],[11.96,12.14,"bitch"],[12.16,12.18,"[00:12.24]"],[12.22,12.4,"Counting"],[12.44,12.58,"money"],[12.66,12.68,"is"],[12.74,12.74,"a"],[12.86,13.1,"habit,"],[13.32,13.56,"triple"],[13.62,13.92,"nine"],[13.96,14.04,"(Oh-oh)"],[14.06,14.14,"[00:14.24]"],[14.18,14.42,"Hop"],[14.52,14.72,"out"],[14.84,14.9,"the"],[15.0,15.38,"coupe,"],[15.46,15.68,"let"],[15.76,15.82,"the"],[15.9,16.24,"doors"],[16.32,16.52,"close"],[16.56,16.8,"(Skrrt-skrrt,"],[16.88,17.14,"skrrt)"],[17.16,17.26,"[00:17.40]"],[17.34,17.6,"Every"],[17.72,17.9,"day"],[17.98,18.1,"I'm"],[18.26,18.38,"off"],[18.46,18.46,"a"],[18.6,19.0,"Xan"],[19.16,19.22,"or"],[19.34,19.34,"a"],[19.48,20.02,"narco"],[20.04,20.06,"[00:20.92]"],[20.88,20.98,"And"],[21.18,21.18,"I"],[21.26,21.42,"know"],[21.48,21.66,"these"],[21.72,22.04,"bitches"],[22.1,22.5,"scan"],[22.62,22.84,"like"],[22.9,22.9,"a"],[23.04,23.86,"barcode"],[23.88,23.98,"[00:24.08]"],[24.02,24.1,"I'm"],[24.18,24.3,"too"],